# Webapp UI/UX Reference

When editing `webapp/src/**` (pages, layouts, components, styles):

1. Read **`documentation/webapp/ui-ux-reference.md`** before changing UI, layout, motion, or visual tokens.
2. Treat it as the source of truth for colors, typography, spacing, motion, and component patterns (Green Mist).
3. Reuse existing primitives in `webapp/src/components/ui` and patterns in `globals.css` / `auth-styles.ts` instead of inventing one-off styles.
4. Do not reintroduce `webapp/PROFESSIONAL_UI_UX_REFERENCE.md` at the webapp root; the canonical doc lives under `documentation/webapp/`.

For marketing-only examples, follow §8 in the reference; dashboards and dense forms follow §1.2 and §13 constraints unless the doc explicitly narrows scope.
